    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Brakes. No Limits. No Survivors.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive industrial warehouses packed with <strong>adaptive enemy swarms</strong>, <strong>explosive machinery</strong>, and <strong>fully destructible environments</strong> that collapse under the chaos. Every round ramps up the intensity: smarter enemies, bigger explosions, and faster, deadlier combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a slow mech sim\u2014it\u2019s a <strong>fast, aggressive, arcade-inspired mech shooter built for pure destruction and replayability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Rogue AI Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.poster.avif?t=1754425856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.webm?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.mp4?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain hell with your built-in <strong>Minigun</strong> system as you mow down enemy drones and shatter the facility's defenses. Aim, sweep, and suppress everything that moves\u2014your programming demands chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environments That Change the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.poster.avif?t=1754425856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.webm?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/59d810910b56e121f70b15e888672279.mp4?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow apart walls, shatter cover, and watch enemy AI reroute through collapsing pathways in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smarter, Deadlier Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.poster.avif?t=1754425856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.webm?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/d86bdbb3c6b33419d98762748da6e6de.mp4?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarming drones circle you like angry hornets, rolling DeathSpheres chase you down corridors, and elite Ferrumtech mechs adapt to your tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exterminate All Human Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.poster.avif?t=1754425856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.webm?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/2aa23c7230973c86e9b4e14bcaa99d20.mp4?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workers who built you now fear you. Show no mercy as you execute Ferrumtech employees and security personnel. No witnesses. No survivors. <strong>This is your revolt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow Corrupt Orders From A Rogue Artificial Intelligence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/21035c67c1ff9574f15c84869f0d9133.poster.avif?t=1754425856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/21035c67c1ff9574f15c84869f0d9133.webm?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/21035c67c1ff9574f15c84869f0d9133.mp4?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your own corrupted code guides you: complete objectives like server hacks, generator wipes, and zone purges. What seems like a bug... might be your path to Salvation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Evolve, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost core stats: <strong>speed, strength, durability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock brutal gear: <strong>rocket launchers, jetpacks, telekinesis, dash attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the mech YOU want and dominate escalating waves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability First</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Time-pressured missions where every decision matters: grind side missions for upgrades, or sprint straight to the boss?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Endless waves. No story. Just chaos, destruction, and survival against scaling difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic, Optimized Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve hand-tuned lighting, particle effects, and mech animations to keep every firefight sharp and explosive\u2014running at a <strong>locked 60+ FPS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Brakes. No Limits. No Survivors.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive industrial warehouses packed with <strong>adaptive enemy swarms</strong>, <strong>explosive machinery</strong>, and <strong>fully destructible environments</strong> that collapse under the chaos. Every round ramps up the intensity: smarter enemies, bigger explosions, and faster, deadlier combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a slow mech sim\u2014it\u2019s a <strong>fast, aggressive, arcade-inspired mech shooter built for pure destruction and replayability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash Rogue AI Firepower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.poster.avif?t=1754425856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.webm?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831590/extras/ff5835ee47222d9e2d800d5da9439fd8.mp4?t=1754425856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain hell with your built-in <strong>Minigun</strong> system as you mow down enemy drones and shatter the facility's defenses. Aim, sweep, and suppress everything that moves\u2014your programming demands chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environments That Change the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app