Replayability First</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Time-pressured missions where every decision matters: grind side missions for upgrades, or sprint straight to the boss?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> Endless waves. No story. Just chaos, destruction, and survival against scaling difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic, Optimized Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve hand-tuned lighting, particle effects, and mech animations to keep every firefight sharp and explosive\u2014running at a <strong>locked 60+ FPS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
